---@field configSteps? gcp.unstable.osconfig_v1alpha.OSPolicyAssignmentReportOSPolicyComplianceOSPolicyResourceComplianceOSPolicyResourceConfigStepList Ordered list of configuration completed by the agent for the OS policy resource.
---@field complianceState? gcp.unstable.osconfig_v1alpha.OSPolicyAssignmentReportOSPolicyComplianceOSPolicyResourceComplianceComplianceStateEnum The compliance state of the resource.
